### Run in IntelliJ: click the green arrow next to each request.
### Role B collects the real test requests in this folder (one .http file per system).

### Epok
GET http://localhost:8081/epok/health
Accept: application/json

### StudentITS
GET http://localhost:8082/studentits/health
Accept: application/json

### Ladok
GET http://localhost:8083/ladok/health
Accept: application/json

### Canvas
GET http://localhost:8084/canvas/health
Accept: application/json

### Canvas -> Epok, StudentITS, Ladok (checks that Canvas can reach the others)
GET http://localhost:8084/canvas/systemstatus
Accept: application/json
